            <ArticleTitle>Skin hygiene for patients with bariatric needs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients with bariatric needs are likely to experience skin problems because maintaining skin hygiene, particularly between skin folds, can be a challenge. This article is a summary of a literature review that explored the evidence on skin hygiene for people with bariatric needs. The findings reveal a gap in the evidence base and the authors make several recommendations for further research.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
